---
import { sitePath } from "../lib/site-paths";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#5f4769" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Sin conexión | Biblioteca Bíblica</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={sitePath("/favicon.svg")} />
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light dark; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; background:#f7f7f8; color:#25232a; }
      * { box-sizing:border-box; }
      body { min-height:100vh; margin:0; display:grid; place-items:center; padding:24px; background:radial-gradient(circle at top right,#eee5f2 0,transparent 38%),#f7f7f8; }
      main { width:min(100%,560px); padding:32px; border:1px solid #ddd8e0; border-radius:24px; background:#fff; box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(31,24,35,.08); }
      .brand { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; color:#5f4769; font-size:.8rem; font-weight:850; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
      h1 { margin:18px 0 10px; font-size:clamp(2rem,7vw,3.2rem); line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.05em; }
      p { margin:0; color:#69636f; line-height:1.7; }
      .actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-top:24px; }
      a,button { min-height:46px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; padding:0 16px; border-radius:12px; font:inherit; font-weight:760; text-decoration:none; cursor:pointer; }
      a { background:#5f4769; color:#fff; border:1px solid #5f4769; }
      button { background:#fff; color:#5f4769; border:1px solid #cbbbd1; }
      small { display:block; margin-top:20px; color:#8a8490; line-height:1.5; }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root { background:#0f1115; color:#f7f9fb; }
        body { background:radial-gradient(circle at top right,#312936 0,transparent 38%),#0f1115; }
        main { background:#171a1f; border-color:#33353b; box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.28); }
        .brand { color:#cbb6d1; }
        p,small { color:#a6aebb; }
        a { background:#b7a0bf; border-color:#b7a0bf; color:#19131b; }
        button { background:#1d2127; color:#cbb6d1; border-color:#48404d; }
      }
      @media(max-width:520px){ main{padding:24px;border-radius:20px}.actions{display:grid}.actions>*{width:100%} }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <span class="brand"><Icon name="library" size={17} /> Bibli</span>
      <h1>Estás sin conexión</h1>
      <p>Las páginas que ya visitaste pueden seguir disponibles. Para contenido que todavía no se haya guardado en este dispositivo, vuelve a intentarlo cuando recuperes la conexión.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href={sitePath("/")}><Icon name="library" size={17} /> Ir al inicio</a>
        <button type="button" onclick="location.reload()"><Icon name="arrow-right" size={17} /> Reintentar</button>
      </div>
      <small>Esta es la base offline de Bibli. La descarga selectiva de paquetes de Biblia, lecciones e imágenes se incorporará como una capa posterior.</small>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
